{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2013-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1368662400, "end_date": 1369353599, "month_true_total": 43, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:55:40 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "3615514", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025269335", "personaname": "Matt Guido", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mattguido/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 548, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 548, "last_played": 1330761600, "avatar": "69ca624d6cb51aaf45e4213ee785b147ae1964b6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great Game", "timestamp_created": 1369320943, "timestamp_updated": 1369320943, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2718447", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011580836", "personaname": "LandyRS", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LandyRS/", "num_games_owned": 1188, "num_reviews": 134, "playtime_forever": 1498, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1284, "last_played": 1480374377, "avatar": "a8091fa7e1c73cf1289ef49f74e105e0c0f5562f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Kind of like L4D mixed with Smash TV and aliens as enemies", "timestamp_created": 1369176018, "timestamp_updated": 1369176018, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4634456", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040110084", "personaname": "osirisfog", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040110084/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 19193, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19151, "last_played": 1466165393, "avatar": "af5dcd5104fc5070e0afb896a76bfde8f174bb40"}, "language": "english", "review": "Alien Swarm is truly the best coop game I've ever played so far. I'm now in the position to compare it to HELLDIVERS.\n\nYou can choose between different unique characters. Some relations between those characters are special and this is reflected through some chatting between them.\n\nThere are four different classes (Officers, Technicians, Medics, Special Soldiers) with unique abilities. Every character has it's own strength and weaknesses concerning his class and thus weapons/items at his disposal.\n\nThere are no useless weapons or items. Even the start rifle is useful for experienced players with high level characters! By the way, no stats of your characters are changed through playing. That's a wonderful feature of this game.\n\nAll missions are meaningful connected with one another. The experience is thrilling but without a horror factor. At later stages you get used to fighting against all kinds of alien threats but it never get's boring or dumb.\n\nThe game stays challenging through various different difficulty levels and different modes like hardcore friendly fire. Thoughtful integrated Steam achievements are one key element in continually challenging the player.\n\nIf you really want to try a good coop game and you like action packed games with an alien theme do yourself a favor and give it a shot. In the beginning I was sceptical too but I never regret I got started with this beautiful coop game.\n\nFive stars!", "timestamp_created": 1369121245, "timestamp_updated": 1451507707, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2779873", "author": {"steamid": "76561198012508319", "personaname": "StonedRanger642", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/StonedRanger642/", "num_games_owned": 249, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1461, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1457, "last_played": 1446706544, "avatar": "fea300d88c859ad635c34fe36785fcc99b54edb2"}, "language": "english", "review": "StonedRanger642's Rating: 10/10\n\nReason, \"Beautiful, Addictive CO-OP. Delivering hours of fun with friends.\"", "timestamp_created": 1369120316, "timestamp_updated": 1369120316, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "6624446", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070780543", "personaname": "KissyFaceCimba", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198070780543/", "num_games_owned": 101, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 1367, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 823, "last_played": 1526137606, "avatar": "9e306e81da183c5bd81293f5817483d40cb4a394"}, "language": "english", "review": "you gonna need do try this", "timestamp_created": 1368893402, "timestamp_updated": 1368893402, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}